{"id": "22-4871-2-2", "zh": "cur 等词根组（curādigaṇa）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4872-2-5", "zh": "下面讲 cur 等词根组。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4873-2-27", "zh": "āpa、kamu、gaṇa、ghaṭa、cinta、ceta、cura、dhara、pāla、pūja、manta、māna、vida。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4874-2-43", "zh": "692. 在 cur 等词根之后加 ṇi［迦 452；色 525；尼 933；旃 1.1.45；波 3.1.25；多部作‘curādito ṇi’］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4875-2-8", "zh": "在 cur 等表示动作意义的词根之后，加上表示自身意义的 ṇi 词缀。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4876-2-5", "zh": "如 coreti、corayati（偷盗）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4877-2-8", "zh": "āpa 加前缀 vi，表示遍及，如 byāpeti、byāpayati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4878-2-19", "zh": "kamu 表示希求，如 kāmeti、kāmayati、kāmenti、kāmayanti、nikāmeti、nikāmayati、nikāmenti、nikāmayanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4879-2-5", "zh": "被动形式：kāmīyati、kāmīyanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4880-2-9", "zh": "使役形式也只加 ṇāpi，如 kāmāpeti、kāmāpayati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4881-2-6", "zh": "使役的被动形式：kāmāpīyati、kāmāpayīyati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4882-2-14", "zh": "gaṇa 表示计数；gaṇa 和 ghaṭa 因为同 tud 等词根一样，不作增音，如 gaṇeti、gaṇayati。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-4883-2-7", "zh": "ghaṭa 表示努力，如 ghaṭeti、ghaṭayati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4884-2-11", "zh": "cinta 表示思惟；因为倒数第二个音节是重音节，不作增音，如 cinteti、cintayati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4885-2-5", "zh": "被动形式：cintīyati、cintīyanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4886-2-5", "zh": "使役形式：cintāpeti、cintāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4887-2-5", "zh": "使役的被动形式：cintāpīyati、cintāpayīyati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4888-2-23", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾（过去时）中：cintesi、cintayi、cinteyuṃ、cintayuṃ、cintesi、cintayi、cintayittha、cintesiṃ、cintayiṃ、cintesimhā、cintayimhā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4889-2-11", "zh": "ceta 表示思惟，如 ceteti、cetayati、cetenti、cetayanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4890-2-11", "zh": "cura 表示偷盗，如 coreti、corayati、corenti、corayanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4891-2-11", "zh": "dhara 表示持有，如 dhāreti、dhārayati、dhārenti、dhārayanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4892-2-11", "zh": "pāla 表示守护，如 pāleti、pālayati、pālenti、pālayanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4893-2-15", "zh": "pūja 表示供养；因为倒数第二个音节是重音节，不作增音，如 pūjeti、pūjayati、pūjenti、pūjayanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4894-2-11", "zh": "manta 表示秘密商议，如 manteti、mantayati、mantenti、mantayanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4895-2-6", "zh": "加前缀 ā，表示告诉和召唤。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4895-7-32", "zh": "如“比丘们，我告诉你们”［长部 2.218］，“世尊召唤比丘们”［长部 2.208］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4896-2-7", "zh": "加前缀 ni，表示邀请，如 nimanteti、nimantayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4897-2-43", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾（过去时）中：mantesi、mantayi、āmantesi、āmantayi、nimantesi、nimantayi、mantesuṃ、mantayuṃ，如“他们到僻静处商议”（mantayiṃsu rahogatā）［本生 2.22.1918］；又如 mantessati、āmantessati、nimantessati、mantayissati、āmantayissati、nimantayissati，等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4898-2-12", "zh": "māna 表示尊敬，如 māneti、mānayati、mānenti、mānayanti，等等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4899-2-11", "zh": "vida 表示感受，如 vedeti、vedayati、paṭisaṃvedeti、paṭisaṃvedayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4900-2-21", "zh": "加前缀 paṭi、ni、pa，表示告知，如 paṭivedeti、paṭivedayati、nivedeti、nivedayati、pavedeti、pavedayati，等等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4901-2-4", "zh": "cur 等词根组完毕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4902-2-4", "zh": "插入词缀（vikaraṇa）部分完毕。", "confidence": 70}
